<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal global trade deficit 918 bln esc Jan-Aug.</title>
<headline>Portugal global trade deficit 918 bln esc Jan-Aug.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portugal's global trade deficit narrowed to 918 billion escudos between January and August from 1,019 billion in same period last year, the National Statistics Institute (INE) said.</p>
<p>		   Jan-Aug 96 Jan-Aug 95 (latest) mth (pvs) mth</p>
<p> Overall balance   -918.4    -1,018.6     -90.2    -100.2</p>
<p> Imports	     3,335.7    3,279.8     283.2     448.5</p>
<p> Exports	     2,417.2    2,261.2     193.0     348.3</p>
<p>Note - Figures are in billions of escudos. A minus sign denotes a deficit. 1995 figures are definitive while 1996 figures are preliminary.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +(351-1) 3538254</p>
